 "Craftmjne (the game) - always at the bottom": "Craftmjne（游戏）——始终在最底层",
 "Higher wins. A pack can retexture a mod and a mod can override a pack, depending on where they sit.\nAuto puts add-ons after the mods they build on and keeps global packs on top.\nPacks reorder at once; a mod's data order applies the next time the world is opened.": "越上面越优先。资源包可以重画模组嘅贴图，模组都可以盖过资源包，视乎佢哋摆喺边。\n自动会将附加包放喺佢哋所依赖嘅模组后面，并将全域资源包保持喺最顶。\n资源包会即刻重新排序；模组嘅资料次序下次打开世界先生效。",
